10\">Aug 25, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/arborvitae-spacing-coverage-cost-calculator\"><img alt=\"How Far Apart to Plant Arborvitae: Spacing, Coverage &amp; Cost Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ad2d32f53f8c749de9cdd9262fa49c875J.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/tree-care\">Tree Care</a><a href=\"/blog/arborvitae-spacing-coverage-cost-calculator\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">How Far Apart to Plant Arborvitae: Spacing, Coverage &amp; Cost Guide</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Calculate exactly how far apart to plant arborvitae for privacy screens or windbreaks, including linear coverage math, 2026 costs, and soil dosage.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>David Park</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-25 02:16:10\">Aug 25, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/how-tall-do-palm-trees-grow-planting-guide\"><img alt=\"How Tall Do Palm Trees Grow? Mature Heights &amp; Planting Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" d